    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40547" root="نكش" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْكُوشٌ</span></b>  A receptacle of the kind called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَفَط</span> <i>of
which the contents have been taken out.</i> (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ مَنْكُوشٌ مِنَ المَنَاكِيشِ</span> (assumed tropical:)  [<i>He is one of those
who are empty,</i> or <i>devoid of good</i>]: a phrase
denoting vituperation. (TA.)

